ote、Numbers 推出集成AI助手","summary":"Apple在Pages、Keynote、Numbers集成基于自研与OpenAI模型的AI助手，支持上下文感知的幻灯片设计、文档重构、数据可视化等。同时Pixelmator新增Generate Fill图像编辑功能，Logic Pro引入AI语音单提示创作能力，Final Cut Pro整合内容库与模板。所有更新将于11月免费开放给现有订阅用户。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1019373/apple-pages-keynote-numbers-ai-chatbot-update","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T13:50:51.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"q6mjasvj6jxr3taprkhtx1fvk","title":"某房产平台在AWS Bedrock上通过评估偏差修正实现模型性能与成本双提升","summary":"某房产平台发现其评估标签存在96.8%的模型偏差，通过重新标注数据和优化提示词，在AWS Bedrock上使用Llama 4模型将准确率提升47%，成本降低86%。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fix-evaluation-bias-to-unlock-better-models-on-amazon-bedrock/","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T16:53:02.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"toln8988lyvkbp8uihkrlx2bj","title":"General Compute完成1亿美元A轮融资，逆势布局AI专用芯片租赁","summary":"General Compute完成1亿美元A轮融资，估值跃升至8亿美元。公司通过合作Nvidia竞争对手的芯片供应商（SambaNova/Positron/Cerebras）和与大型云公司签订百万美元年营收合同，采用租赁数据中心和改造比特币挖矿场的方式提供AI推理算力，形成差异化竞争策略。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/general-compute-raises-100-million-series-a-countering-the-neocloud-disaster-narrative/","publishedAt":"2026-10-2