用于 AI 基础设施建设。AMD 和 Broadcom 也表达了对 Meta 股票的兴趣。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/meta-gets-3-billion-from-nvidia-and-plans-to-spend-more-on-nvidia-chips/","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T09:58:16.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"论文研究","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"hw2m26kmmhwc8siy6g14zploa","title":"Hugging Face发布论文及基准：LLM评估研究新颖性存在显著偏差","summary":"Hugging Face发布论文及基准，揭示LLM评估研究新颖性存在显著偏差：测试6种模型时，提示词细微调整导致准确率波动超50个百分点；简单提示词（Claude Opus 4.6）成本仅$2.59且准确率达0.854，优于专用系统（$82.05/0.772）。研究显示AI生成内容评估易受提示词设计影响，且检索增强未显著提升判断稳定性。","sourceName":"Hugging Face Blog","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/novelty-bench","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:42.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"bjoxdidgwpiyqmdsee4d1d3mb","title":"Google Research提出睡眠框架：LLM持续学习中的新型知识保留方法","summary":"Google Research提出睡眠框架解决LLM持续学习中的灾难性遗忘问题，在长文本理解与数学推理基准测试中表现优于GPT-4等基线方法。该框架通过参数扩展与混合专家架构（MoE）实现动态知识存储，结合知识蒸馏（GKD）与强化学习（RL）的模拟训练（dreaming）机制，在10M tokens长上下文场景下保持近零性能衰减，数学推理准确率达79.2%。","sourceName":"Google Research","sourceUrl":"https://research.google/blog/the-sleep-framework-a-new-way-for-llms-to-retain-knowledge-in-continual-learning/","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T17:35:28.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"vb4040txugjy83yki0p7jyi7e","title":"Google DeepMind 发布 Genie 4 世界模型，新增音频与实时交互功能","summary":"Google DeepMind 发布 Genie 4 世界模型，新增音频生成与实时交互功能。该模型支持自由编辑天气、镜头角度及物体添加，场景维持时长提升至两分钟，物理引擎和角色拟人化程度优于前代。与 Gemini 模型整合后，可通过 Argon 版本拆解任务并实时模拟，实验显示可用于机器人场景预演。影视行业或受益于其原型设计能力，但音频准确性和文本可读性仍有优化空间。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/googles-genie-4-world-model-adds-audio-more-realistic-worlds-and-real-time-steering/","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T16:30:57.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"技巧与观点","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/b360a0b28a4cc3f066128c38e337283bbce79f5b511877df2f99dc16915aca83.jpg","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/268d0239821ef3cacb17aa0a9476a08fd78d381a34c85b5c9dc15805ebd24e62.jpg 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/b360a0b28a4cc3f066128c38e337283bbce79f5b511877df2f99dc16915aca83.jpg 96w","itemId":"h9ufdylguhe7obh71p8tf22ep","title":"离线使用 OpenCode 编程代理的实践指南：喜马拉雅山麓测试实录","summary":"Rittika Jindal 在喜马拉雅山麓离线测试了 OpenCode 编程代理，成功修复测试用例中的小数运算问题。具体实现：1）通过 Ollama 本地运行 Qwen3.5 9B 模型；2）配置 OpenCode 使用项目内单元测试（python3 -m unittest -v）；3）断网后执行代码修改并验证测试通过。","sourceName":"Latent Space","sourceUrl":"https://latent.space/p/offline-coding/","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T14:41:25.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"uc6l6g619dwy7hc8cg6bs0i8o","title":"Exowatt利用SageMaker无服务器模型定制实现边缘与云端部署的Qwen3微调模型成本降低49倍","summary":"Exowatt通过SageMaker serverless模型定制服务，在边缘和云端部署了Qwen3-1.7B（边缘报警分类）和Qwen3-14B（能源市场分析）微调模型，分别达到0.911和0.975宏F1分数，成本降至$0.60/千次推理（原Claude Opus 4.7为$29.26）。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/exowatt-beats-frontier-models-on-accuracy-with-sagemaker-serverless-model-customization/","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T16:50:55.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot